      "body": "Complete. DoD status: (1) canonical definition documented in docs/transformerless/GLOSSARY.md — mean cross-entropy of the true next token under the scorer's predicted distribution, (1/N) Σ −log2 P_scorer(v_i|c_i) with floor mass included, implemented in score.rs::outcome_bits (Gate C harness). (2) Comparability rule explicit: values comparable only within same scorer AND same distribution; the historical 'families' annotated as scorer/distribution differences in BASELINE.md (6.54 = P2 WB legacy corpus, 11.88 = Gate C baseline fixture, 9.86 = Rule 1+2 fixture), with the requirement that reports name scorer + distribution. (3) Field name verified consistent: bits_per_token across GateCMetrics, per-status metrics, and score_report.json schema; the certificate path references external metric CIDs per its schema (no divergent local field).",
